sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User/Browser
    participant C as Client (React)
    participant DB as TanStack DB (Local)
    participant S as Server Functions
    participant ST as Stripe API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant E as Electric Sync
    participant R as Resend Email

    Note over U,R: Checkout Flow

    %% Add to Cart
    U->>C: Add product to cart
    C->>DB: Write to local cart collection
    DB-->>C: Optimistic update
    C-->>U: Cart updated (instant)

    %% View Cart
    U->>C: Navigate to cart
    C->>DB: useLiveQuery(cart items)
    DB-->>C: Cart data with products
    C-->>U: Display cart

    %% Initiate Checkout
    U->>C: Click "Checkout"
    C->>S: createCheckoutSession(cartItems)

    S->>PG: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    S->>PG: Validate inventory availability
    PG-->>S: Stock levels

    alt Sufficient Stock
        S->>ST: Create Payment Intent
        ST-->>S: Payment Intent + Client Secret

        S->>PG: Create order (pending)
        S->>PG: Reserve inventory
        S->>PG: COMMIT

        S-->>C: Return client secret + order ID

        C->>C: Load Stripe.js
        C-->>U: Show payment form

        %% Payment Flow
        U->>C: Enter payment details
        C->>ST: Confirm payment
        ST-->>C: Payment succeeded

        C->>S: confirmOrder(orderId, paymentIntentId)
        S->>PG: Update order status to 'confirmed'
        S->>PG: Decrement inventory

        PG->>E: Notify change (logical replication)
        E->>DB: Sync order + inventory

        S->>R: Send order confirmation email
        R-->>S: Email sent

        S-->>C: Order confirmed

        C->>DB: Clear cart
        DB-->>C: Cart cleared
        C-->>U: Redirect to order confirmation

        Note over U,DB: Real-time sync updates inventory across all clients

    else Insufficient Stock
        S->>PG: ROLLBACK
        S-->>C: Error: Out of stock
        C-->>U: Show error message
    end

    %% Webhook Flow (async)
    Note over ST,PG: Stripe Webhook (parallel)
    ST->>S: webhook: payment_intent.succeeded
    S->>PG: Verify order payment status
    S->>PG: Update payment metadata
    S-->>ST: 200 OK
